        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ Friction Hold Open Closer Arm</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFits <a href=\"/products/commercial-ada-compliant-full-cover-surface-mount-closer-american-eagle-5100\"><b>American Eagle 5100 Door Closers</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-door-closer-pdq-5101-bcpa-605\"><b>Polished Brass Door Closer</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-delayed-action-handicap-door-closer-american-eagle-5141-bcpa\"><b>American Eagle 5141 Delayed Action Handicap Door Closer</b></a> (for 11 mm closer pinion shaft). \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Includes <a href=\"/products/friction-hold-open-arm-parallel-arm-bracket-for-american-eagle-5100-pdq-999022\">Parallel Arm Bracket</a>.</b> Can be mounted regular, top jamb or parallel arm.<br>\r\n<b>Note: </b>For Hold Open to function properly when regular or top jamb mounting the door closer, door must open a <b>minimum of 90 degrees</b>. When parallel mounting minimum door opening is 40 degrees \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"#N/A\"><b>PDQ 999016 Thumb Turn Hold Open Arm</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAdjustable arm length and degree that the door is held open. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Available in 3 painted finishes of Aluminum, Dark Bronze or Gold and 2 plated finishes, Polished Brass or Satin Chrome.\r\n</p>",
